   "en": "§ The mishna teaches: «And the same» halakha applies «in» a case where the ox killed «a boy or in» a case where it killed «a girl. The Sages taught:» The verse states: «“Whether it has gored a son or has gored a daughter”» (Exodus 21:31), «to deem» the owner «liable for» the death of «minors» just «as for adults.»"
